              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo abe ari yo iba imirimo y'imiryango y'Abagerushoni yo mu ihema ry'ibonaniro, imirimo barindishijwe bajye bayikoreshwa na Itamari mwene Aroni umutambyi.",
          "type": "text",
